+[28C[4A]0;⠂ Claude Code[28D[4B[5A[48;5;237m[38;5;239m❯ [38;5;231m# T3: Full-Text Search Feature[39m                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B  [38;5;231m## Category[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                               [1B  [38;5;231mfeatures/medium[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                           [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Timeout[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m30 minutes[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Description[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mAn existing Express + SQLite note-taking API has CRUD endpoints for notes (title, body, tags, timestamps) and tag-based filtering. Add full-text search using SQLite FTS5.[39m                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Requirements[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 1. Search Endpoint: `GET /notes/search?q=<query>`[39m                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Full-text search across note titles and bodies using SQLite FTS5[39m                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Results ranked by relevance (BM25 ranking)[39m                                                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Snippet highlighting with `<mark>` tags around matched terms[39m                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Quoted phrase support (e.g., `?q="exact phrase"`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Pagination: 20 results per page, controlled by `?page=N` parameter[39m                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Response format: `{ results: SearchResult[], total: number, page: number, perPage: number }`[39m                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Returns 400 if `q` parameter is missing or empty[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 2. Suggest Endpoint: `GET /notes/search/suggest?q=<prefix>`[39m                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Autocomplete that returns up to 5 matching note titles[39m                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Matches prefix against note content (title and body)[39m                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Response format: `{ results: SuggestResult[] }`[39m                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Returns 400 if `q` parameter is missing or empty[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### 3. FTS Index Synchronization[39m                                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- FTS index must stay in sync when notes are created, updated, or deleted[39m                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- Use SQLite triggers or manual sync in the CRUD operations[39m                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Interfaces (already defined in `src/models.ts`)[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
